the n0 is steprandom
the n1 is drummap
the n2 is trigdelay
the n3 is smoothrandom
the n4 is rungler 2 att.pitch=-1.18 chaos=0.025
the n5 is compressor
n3 -150> n1
n5.gain >| n1.y
n2 -> n1.density
n1.hat -20> n1.reset
fader2 -150> n2
n2 => n3
value 20 -> n3.follow
n4.steps ~> n4
n4.b -> n4
n4 -> n4.chaos
n4 >| n5
n5 -> left
n3 -> left
n2 -> right
n1 -> out
